# Backend rules

See `packages/core/standards/backend.md` and `api.md`.

Highlights:
- Validate input at the boundary; translate to domain types.
- Auth/authz on every endpoint.
- Structured logs with request IDs.
- Idempotent writes; `Idempotency-Key` header.
- Errors typed, mapped at the edge, never leak stack traces to clients.
- Health endpoints: `/healthz`, `/readyz`.
